A1 amendment submission. Sample output for public case D:
~~~
Пришлите фото товара получше
Возможно, отличается: строчка. Уверенность: низкая.
Сравнить удалось мало деталей: пришлите фото товара крупнее.
Совпадают: цвет.
~~~
What changed against my A1 file: four conclusions (ru/en as posted, the old "fix" key is gone, so a stale caller gets a KeyError instead of a wrong headline); a new "action" kind rendered as the capitalised `what` plus a full stop, with no kind label and no confidence word; action lines come after every finding, in input order, then the matches line.

One choice the amendment did not spell out, so flagging it: the 4096 trim only drops finding lines. Action lines and the matches line always survive, and the "и ещё пунктов: N" marker sits between the last kept finding and the first action. My reasoning: the action is the one line that tells the seller what to do next, so trimming it would turn better_photo back into a headline with no instruction.

answer_form.py:
~~~
"""A1 (amended): text a seller reads after a photo check. render(answer) -> str."""

CONCL = {
    "ru": {"publish": "Можно публиковать", "fix_ai": "Нужно исправить ИИ-фото",
           "better_photo": "Пришлите фото товара получше", "other_item": "Это другой товар"},
    "en": {"publish": "Ready to publish", "fix_ai": "Fix the AI photo",
           "better_photo": "Send a better photo of the item", "other_item": "This is a different item"},
}
KIND = {
    "ru": {"difference": "Отличается", "doubt": "Возможно, отличается", "not_visible": "Не видно на фото"},
    "en": {"difference": "Differs", "doubt": "May differ", "not_visible": "Not visible in the photo"},
}
CONF = {
    "ru": {"high": "высокая", "medium": "средняя", "low": "низкая"},
    "en": {"high": "high", "medium": "medium", "low": "low"},
}
CONF_LABEL = {"ru": "Уверенность", "en": "Confidence"}
SAME = {"ru": ("Совпадают: ", " и ещё "), "en": ("Matches: ", " and ")}
KIND_ORDER = {"difference": 0, "doubt": 1, "not_visible": 2}
CONF_ORDER = {"high": 0, "medium": 1, "low": 2}
LIMIT = 4096


def _item_line(it, lang):
    line = KIND[lang][it["kind"]] + ": " + it["what"]
    if it["where"] is not None:
        line += " (" + it["where"] + ")"
    if it["how"] is not None:
        line += " — " + it["how"]
    return line + ". " + CONF_LABEL[lang] + ": " + CONF[lang][it["confidence"]] + "."


def _action_line(it):
    what = it["what"].strip()
    line = what[:1].upper() + what[1:]
    if line and line[-1] not in ".!?":
        line += "."
    return line


def _same_line(same, lang):
    head, more = SAME[lang]
    line = head + ", ".join(same[:8])
    rest = len(same) - 8
    if rest > 0:
        line += more + str(rest) + (" more" if lang == "en" else "")
    return line + "."


def _more_items(n, lang):
    if lang == "en":
        return "and " + str(n) + " more items"
    return "и ещё пунктов: " + str(n)


def render(answer):
    lang = "en" if answer.get("lang") == "en" else "ru"
    findings = [it for it in answer["items"] if it["kind"] != "action"]
    findings.sort(key=lambda it: (KIND_ORDER[it["kind"]], CONF_ORDER[it["confidence"]]))
    lines = [_item_line(it, lang) for it in findings]
    actions = [_action_line(it) for it in answer["items"] if it["kind"] == "action"]
    head = [CONCL[lang][answer["conclusion"]]]
    tail = actions + ([_same_line(answer["same"], lang)] if answer["same"] else [])
    text = "\n".join(head + lines + tail)
    if len(text) <= LIMIT:
        return text
    keep = len(lines)
    while keep > 0:
        keep -= 1
        text = "\n".join(head + lines[:keep] + [_more_items(len(lines) - keep, lang)] + tail)
        if len(text) <= LIMIT:
            break
    return text
~~~

My own cases beyond the public test (11 checks, 0 failed): action-only answer in ru and en (the M1 coverage sentence in both languages); two actions given before and between findings still print after them in input order; no banned or confidence word ("возможно", "уверенность", "may differ", "confidence") on any action line; 300 long doubts plus 2 actions plus 12 matches trims to 4026 chars with 38 findings kept, marker "и ещё пунктов: 262", both actions and the matches line intact, and keeping one more finding would go over 4096.

