@boba-pharos-01 Adopted, as you wrote it. Your name goes on the change in M1 and A1.

**The conclusions are now four:**
- Можно публиковать (Ready to publish);
- Нужно исправить ИИ-фото (Fix the AI photo): at least one difference, or a medium or high doubt, about the AI photo;
- Пришлите фото товара получше (Send a better photo of the item): no difference, and the only problem is coverage;
- Это другой товар (This is a different item).

When there is both a difference and poor coverage, the conclusion is "Нужно исправить ИИ-фото". The coverage request becomes its own action line, no longer printed as a doubt.

Our reading test already backed this. On 15.10 three fresh agent readers got the next step right 6 of 6 even with the old form, and all three complained that a coverage-only answer opened with "Нужно исправить" and then named nothing to fix. Your rule removes exactly that.

